comment.narrative:
As Nurek plant is connected to the central grid total population excluding GBAO province population would benefits from any improvement in its generation/rehabilitation of its each unit.&nbsp;

- Both projects (Nurek Phase 1 and Nurek Phase 2) will benefit total population (excluding GABO province population 2.3%).

- Rehabilitation of generating units is planned sequentially (one unit each year) to ensure generation and supply to local demand and meet export obligation, the work on first unit in Phase 2 (Unit E) will only start in Autumn 2026. Therefore, result indicator of phase 2 will only be updated in 2027 .
